{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000121447","bookName":"El día en que él me soltó","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000121447/41000121447.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1574679,"followCount":24407,"introduction":"Cuando Helena Linares perdió la vista, Samuel Herrera permaneció a su lado durante cinco años, hasta que su hermano le robó la identidad y el crédito. Traicionado y acusado injustamente, murió lleno de resentimiento. Al renacer, intenta dejar atrás el dolor, pero el pasado no lo deja ir. Cuando un reloj desata falsas acusaciones, vuelve a ser rechazado. Solo cuando Helena descubre la verdad se da cuenta de su error, pero para entonces, él ya le pertenece a alguien más.","chapterCount":71,"labels":["Rebirth","Family Bonds"],"tags":["Rebirth","Family Bonds"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-día-en-que-él-me-soltó","bookNameLower":"el-día-en-que-él-me-soltó","shelfTime":"2025-09-24 15:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2025-09-24 15:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"20097","performerName":"Jialin Wang","performerFormatName":"Jialin-Wang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x9/20097/20097.jpg?time=1786009692851","videoCount":3},{"performerId":"20513","performerName":"Wenzhuo Lu","performerFormatName":"Wenzhuo-Lu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x1/20513/20513.jpg?time=1788919006884","videoCount":4}],"performerIdList":[20097,20513]},"chapterList":[{"id":"600724726","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/62/7x4/74x4/744x1/74412100014/600724726_1/600724726.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795201200&Signature=XR-k-RzAiXt11OKKQI03KuVH6V0wjwNtxr9ouUToBNwKBmgf02KMacFeUYhfE0zy5pEojlKbzIQaXaOc6IacCq9j42cHUKV-yJ9zfsxYMxxOdOtp9ox5Rbx8qH4yvqNy9d~7bBBu5nZpkqctOGVAw~-qrq20VEm5mi7JLtnljMg7lQCFl0dy9